<title>CANADA: Canada Oct natural gas sales rise 11.4 percent.</title>
<headline>Canada Oct natural gas sales rise 11.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian sales of natural gas rose 11.4 percent in October from the same month a year earlier, to 5,006,160,000 cubic metres, Statistics Canada said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Thousands of cubic meters and percentage changes:</p>
<p>					Oct 96	Oct 95	Pct</p>
<p>Total			     5,006,160    4,492,192  +11.4</p>
<p>Residential sales	     1,019,670	908,002  +12.3</p>
<p>Commercial sales		  746,694	689,386   +8.3</p>
<p>Industrial			2,161,202    1,972,849    n/a</p>
<p>Direct sales		    1,078,594	921,955</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Gary Smalldridge, Energy Section, at 613-951-3567)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613 235-6745))</p>
